# Puts SITL back in Stabilize. Not a test: a script that flew and landed leaves the copter in
# Land, which is not a mode it arms in, and every later script that expects "Ready to Arm" or an
# arming then fails. Run this before such scripts when SITL has been left that way.
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tools/gui/sitl-stabilize.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
screen fly
window 1600x1200
settle 6
click fly-tab-actions
expect fly.tab tabActions
click Stabilize
settle 2
expect vehicle.mode Stabilize
